    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really exhausted and i hate going to the doctors for nothing if it's just travel stuff. its probably just the pressure changes and sitting too long right? i dont have a fever or anything so it doesnt feel like an emergency. u think i should just take some ibuprofen and sleep it off for a bit?",
