      "content": "idk a travel clinic sounds like a lot of effort too... honestly the pain in my leg isnt even that bad, just a dull ache. and the chest thing is mostly just when i take a crazy deep breath. i'm sure it'll be fine once i get some sleep. can u just tell me if it's safe to just sleep it off tonight? i'll check in the morning if it's still there.",
